        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Doug Basham, Danny Basham\n- Teams: The Basham Brothers\n- Organizations: World Wrestling Entertainment, Total Nonstop Action Wrestling\n- Roles: professional wrestling tag team, professional wrestler\n\nFacts:\n- Doug Basham was born on May 12, 1971.\n- Doug Basham's full name is Lyle Douglas \"Doug\" Basham Jr.\n- Doug Basham is an American professional wrestler.\n- The Basham Brothers were a professional wrestling tag team composed of Doug Basham and Danny Basham.\n- Doug Basham is best known for appearing with World Wrestling Entertainment from 2002 to 2007.\n- Doug Basham appeared in Total Nonstop Action Wrestling in 2007 under the ring name Basham.",
